{"name": "3D Escape Room: Cursed Legacy", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the sequel to <i>3D Escape Room: Mystic Manor</i>\u2014<strong><i>3D Escape Room: Cursed Legacy</i></strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a 3D realistic puzzle escape game. In the game, you inherit your grandfather\u2019s legacy\u2014a manor\u2014only to find yourself trapped in danger within a place filled with secrets. As you resolve the crisis, you gradually uncover the past of your grandfather and the manor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the danger finally passes and you stop to look back, you may be able to piece together the whole story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features 16 distinct rooms, a wide variety of puzzles and mechanisms, and clues and records from different eras\u2026 Use your observation and logic to unravel it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/f8cff6d8b8f1820636314f6465db6fc8.poster.avif?t=1785212586\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/f8cff6d8b8f1820636314f6465db6fc8.webm?t=1785212586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/f8cff6d8b8f1820636314f6465db6fc8.mp4?t=1785212586\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Classic Eyepiece</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With it, you can open another visual dimension\u2014see through surfaces to manipulate the mechanisms inside, and discover mysterious clues invisible to the naked eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/f0505228563aa1e4bd1e78ab965670a3.poster.avif?t=1785212586\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/f0505228563aa1e4bd1e78ab965670a3.webm?t=1785212586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/f0505228563aa1e4bd1e78ab965670a3.mp4?t=1785212586\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time Intertwined</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of the \u201cNameless Stone\u201d to experience the overlap of two different timelines. Build connections between shifting scenes and information to uncover the truth buried by time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/bcbf246711232bd57dd9664155469a94.poster.avif?t=1785212586\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/bcbf246711232bd57dd9664155469a94.webm?t=1785212586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/bcbf246711232bd57dd9664155469a94.mp4?t=1785212586\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mad Fantasies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As reason begins to crumble, can memory still be trusted? Step into a surreal world of strange sights and experience the mad scientist\u2019s fantasy firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/e1c214dd0142203557a73db7a97e0f95.poster.avif?t=1785212586\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/extras/e1c214dd0142203557a73db7a97e0f95.webm?t=1785212586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "After waking up in the manor\u2019s basement, you discover that you\u2019ve aged at an abnormal rate. As you fight to survive, clues and records from different eras gradually bring the mystery into focus. When you become young again, you will inherit the true \u201clegacy\u201d.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175140/64573e3c64f42959ae72d5906afd386724a99e97/header.jpg?t=1785212586", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Adventure", "3D", "Casual", "Mystery", "Point & Click"], "developers": "Shenzhen Zhonglian Interactive Technology Co.,Ltd", "publishers": "Shenzhen Zhonglian Interactive Technology Co.,Ltd", "release_date": "Apr 15, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "4175140", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/DaEK4LyK_94", "first_seen": 1770073200.0, "review_rank": 1299}